2 CONT
2 CONT * https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Store_nr_79#TAB_4
2 CONT * https://www.siverud.se/p582.htm
2 CONT * http://www.roskildehistorie.dk/stamtavler/adel/svenske/Store/Store.htm
