2 CONC A&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwiUxIW--vriAhVzCjQIHZPXDBo4ChDoATAUegQIBxAB#v=onepage&q=Brita%20Hård%20af%20Segerstad&f=false
2 CONT * von Nackreij - Skytte, Volume 3 - https://books.google.com/books?id=8nbUjE7AsQYC&pg=PA229&lpg=PA229&dq=Brita+Hård+af+Segerstad&source=bl&ots=LJc3oGdIxI&sig=ACfU3U1IrfnxGFk7cxx8GYVfDkf9mRWP5Q&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjHmKaU-_riAhUwH
