1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Kerstin Anundsdotter Ulfsax=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Father- Anund Jönsson (son of Jöns Pedersson, tab 1), to Byerum (in Åby parish, Kalm.?). Lived in 1520, died before 1526. Married before 1514-01-18 with Carin Hansdotter in her 1st marriage (married 2 o'clock before 1526 with ch
2 CONC ieftain Harald Knutsson ( Soop ), dead 1530. Married 3: o before 1536 with the teamman in Västergötland Olof Pedersson to Stora Bjurum, who received a letter of rescues and wrestling from 1541-07-29 with a sculpted eagle foot in t
2 CONC he shield and on the helmet, lived in 1554), died before 1554-07-25, when the inheritance was executed after her at Stora Bjurum, daughter of the knight, the council and the teamman at Närke Hans Åkesson ( Tott ) and Kerstin Eriks
2 CONC dotter ( Gyllenstierna of Lundholm ).
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children:=
2 CONT
2 CONT Kerstin Anundsdotter , lived 1554-07-25 at the turn of the century. Married 1533-08-03 at Nyköping Castle with Sten Bengtsson ( backing wolf ) to Stäflö in Åby parish Kalmar County. In 1556 she moved to Germany with German [https:
2 CONC //www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Pipare Jöran (Jürgen) Piper]. 
2 CONT
2 CONT https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Ulfsax_nr_107#TAB_2
2 CONT
2 CONT Kerstin Eriksdotter (dead 1509), Hans Åkesson (Tott); their daughter Karin Hansdotter married Harald Knutsson Soop.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Links=
2 CONT
