2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Sources=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT *  Kerstin rymde 1556, efter makens död, till Tyskland med Jöran pipare. 
2 CONT * Gustaf Elgenstierna , The introduced genealogical tables of the Swedish nobility. 1925-36
2 CONT * Ulfsax , died unmarried 1755-08-30 in Virserum parish, Kalmar county.
