2 CONT 💞 Claes Claesson Uggla, III is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Claes-Uggla-III?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=inlaw&to=6000000012566391180 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 7th great granddaughter's ex-husban
