2 CONT * [https://arkivkopia.se/bok/runeberg-ladal '''Now called Kristineberg. In 1681 it also bore the name of an old manor house. Owned then by wife Karin Svenske: 1683 by Ingehorg Silfversvärd. Yar Linnart Svinhufvud's estate in 1664.
2 CONC  Bought from the provost Nils Hessel-gren in 1697 by the county chief J. Leijonbjelke for 510 r:dr curant, d. eh. 765 dalers silver coins. Built in 1805 by the provost L. Wallstedt; 1850 by commission surveyor H. Marin. m. fl.''']
