1 NOTE {geni:about_me} * Reference: [https://www.myheritage.com/research/record-1-179079102-1-500008/ingeborg-larsdotter-svenske-fodd-dufva-in-myheritage-family-trees?indId=externalindividual-01d574d084b96d96e533139bd8bc2f1a&mrid=fa5aa3b
