2 CONC  (Writings by Sv. Literatursällsk. In Finland, 262, 1937); [F. Drake], A picture from the fight between Karl and Sigismund. Arvid Drake to Hagelsrum (New Wexiöbladet 20 Sept. 1898; sign .: T. D-el); A. Jonsson, Duke Karl and Sigis
2 CONC mund 1597–1598 (Gothenburg Science and Science Society Act, 4: 9, 1906); SU Palme, Sweden and Denmark 1596-1611 (1942); L F. Rääf, Collections and notes to a description of the Outer Heart, [1] & 3 (1856, 61); W. Sten-hammar & R. 
