1 NOTE {geni:about_me} = Kerstin Bengtsdotter ( Kompan, chevron over leaves)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Bengt Turesson (Sparre över blad) and Märta Gunnarsdotter Gylta.
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Drake_af_Intorp_nr_82#TAB_5 Noble Family Drake af Intorp nr 82, by Adelsvapen]
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TAB 3'''
2 CONT
2 CONT Knut Arvidsson (son of Arvid Jönsson, Tab. 2 ). to Torpa in Länghem parish, Älvsborg county. Called a gunsmith 1438-12-14. District chief in Kinds district still 1458. Died 1459 (RHKn.). '''Married 1439 to Kerstin Bengtsdotter (Ko
2 CONC mpan) , widow lived 1459, daughter of the Halland gunsmith Bengt Turesson ( Kompan , chevron over leaves) and Märta Gunnarsdotter ( Gylta ).'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Children''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Arvid Knutsson.''' Riksråd and lagman. Died 1497. 
2 CONT * '''Märta Knutsdotter.''' Married in 1487 to the district chief Bror Buth in his 2nd marriage (g. 1: o married Margareta Mårtensdotter, daughter of Mårten Svensson), still living in 1507.
2 CONT * '''Ingrid Knutsdotter.''' (also called Ingegärd) Married to the gunsmith Håkan Karlsson Tun .
2 CONT * ''Brita Knutsdotter.'''  Married to Nils (? Halvardsson) ( wave under half a star ).
2 CONT * '''Karin Knutsdotter,''' dead childless
2 CONT
2 CONT [HONOR; SoH: 1955 s290; SoH: 1959 sl73ff; SoH: 1969 s232ff; ÄSF: I s216]
