1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Karin Stensdotter (Ulv)=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Daughter of Sten Bengtsson (Ulv) and Kerstin Anundsdotter, till Byerum
2 CONT * Karin Stensdotter. Written in 1579 to Kyrketorp in Kläckeberga sn. Norra Möre hd in Småland but 1.1 1581 to a difficult location Askö, 1583 and 1600 to Horsö in Kläckeberga and 1605 to Stävlö in Åby sn. Norra Möre hd. Can not be
2 CONC  put to life after 1605 and died in 1611. First married to Hans Gedhardt von Lewenstein , who lived yet 1576, then with Jakob Björnsson (Boat) who would have died before 1.11581, and finally in Kalmar 6.71589 with Christoffer Ande
2 CONC rsson ( Gyllengrip ), which was probably born in 1518, where the king's chamberfather 1561 and chamber servant in 1562 became the captain of the war 19.2 1563, the captain of the war people in Stockholm 1.11 1563 and underamiral 1
2 CONC 8.5 1564, 1564-1571 were Danish prisoners, then Hov-junkers, 1578 the princess Elisabet's chieftain, attended Borgholm 1579-1584 and at Kalmar 1587-1590, and chieftain in Algutsrums and Förbohd in Öland 1579-1583 and in Norra Möre
2 CONC  1589-1599 and formerly married 10.11 1577 at Uppsala Castle with Gertrud Ulfsdotter ( Boat ), which died 19.4 1588. His seat was 1573-1577 Boatorp in Moheda sn. Allbo hd but from 1578 Stensnäs in Ryssby sn, Sunnerbo hd. Hacked in
2 CONC  Kalmar 16.5 1599.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married: '''(1) Hans''' Gedhardt von Lewenstein, who was still alive in 1576, '''(2) Jakob Björnsson (Bååt),''' who probably died before 1.1 1581, and finally in Kalmar 6.7 1589,  '''(3) Christoffer Andersson (Gyllengrip),''' wh
2 CONC o according to probably incorrect information was born in 1518 , was the king's chamberlain in 1561 and chamberlain in 1562, became chief of the ship 19.2 1563, captain of the men-of-war in Stockholm 1.11 1563 and rear admiral 18.
2 CONC 5 1564, was a Danish prisoner in 1564-1571, then a court-junker, in 1578 princess Elisabeth's court master, bailiff at Borgholm 1579-1584 and in Kalmar 1587-1590 and district governor in Algutsrums and Förbo hd in Öland 1579-1583 
2 CONC and in Norra Möre 1589-1599 and previously married on 10.11.1577 at Uppsala Castle to Gertrud Ulfsdotter (Bååt), who died on 19.4.1588. His seat farm was 1573-1577 Boatorp in Moheda sn. Allbo hd but from 1578 Stensnäs in Ryssby sn
2 CONC , Sunnerbo hd. Beheaded in Kalmar 16.5 1599
2 CONT
2 CONT ==[http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Tillbakaseende_ulv#TAB_20 Looking Back Wolf, by Adelsvapen Genealogies]
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT  TABLE 20
2 CONT Sten Bengtsson (son of Bengt Knutsson, tab. 19). Appears earliest in 1527. Became 13.8 1534 district chief in Södra Möre hd in Småland, which he probably was until 23.7 1537. Mentioned 1545-1553 as district chief in Gräsgårds hd o
2 CONC n Öland and again in Södra Möre. His seat farm was Stävlö in Åby sn, Norra Möre hd in Småland. Died between 16.2 and 25.7 1554. Said to have married 20.7 1533 to Kerstin Anundsdotter, who inherited land in Aska, Bobergs, Hanekinds
2 CONC , Vifolka and Ydre hd in Östergötland, Glanshammars and Mellösa hd in Närke, Konga and Uppvidinge hd in Småland and Vilske hd in Västergötland and was the daughter of Anund Jönsson ( Ulfsax ) and Karin Hansdotter ( Tott ). In 1556
2 CONC  she escaped to Germany with the German Jöran piper.
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Anund Stensson,''' 1560, died 1580, horse master, district chief. See tab. 21.
2 CONT * '''Claus Stensson.''' In 1562 owned land in Rönö hd in Södermanland and Södra Möre hd in Småland. Ensign at Östgöta rider at the latest in 1564. Fell in the battle at Svartrå or Axtorna in Halland 20.10.1565.
2 CONT * '''Anna Stensdotter.''' Still had Stävlö in Åby sn. in 1590. Norra Möre hd, as seat farm. Was possibly dead in 1591, the information that she was still alive in 1600 has not been able to be verified. She was buried in Åby church
2 CONC . Married no later than 1570 to Johan Siggeson ( Svartingstorpsätten), who was born in Birsta in Sköns sn in Medelpad, was bailiff of the king's inheritance and property in Östergötland västanstång 1557-1558, paid the tithe of Vis
2 CONC ta and Tveta hd in Småland 1558, was bailiff of Bobergs hd in Östergötland and in Möre 1561- 1564, became prefect of Lysings hd in Östergötland 3.3 1558, was prefect of Östra hd in Småland 1562 and in Åkerbo hd on Öland 1563-1565,
2 CONC  became chieftain 10.6 1564 led valleymen who were to march into Norway and commander-in-chief of the troops in Norrland 6.1 1565 with the title field colonel, was Swedish lawman in the occupied Norwegian provinces Jämtland and Hä
2 CONC rjedalen from 15.12 1564, in Härjedalen only until 1565 but in Jämtland until 1571, became commander of Vadstena castle and town 13.11 1571, knighted 25.9 1572,was written in 1569 to a not closer located Söderby, but at least from
2 CONC  1574 to Svartingstorp in Åby sn, Norra Möre hd in Småland, where he received a crown residence in 1571, and died between 19.5 1579 and 1.1 1581.
2 CONT * '''Karin Stensdotter.''' Written in 1579 to Kyrketorp in Kläckeberga sn. Norra Möre hd in Småland but 1.1 1581 to a difficult to locate Askö, 1583 and 1600 to Horsö in Kläckeberga and 1605 to Stävlö in Åby sn. Norra Møre hd. Can
2 CONC 't be proven alive after 1605 and was dead in 1611. Married first to Hans Gedhardt von Lewenstein , who was still alive in 1576, then to Jakob Björnsson (Bååt), who probably died before 1.1 1581, and finally in Kalmar 6.7 1589 to 
2 CONC Christoffer Andersson ( Golden grip), who according to probably incorrect information was born in 1518, was the king's chamberlain in 1561 and chamberlain in 1562, became a midshipman 19.2 1563, captain of the men-of-war in Stockh
2 CONC olm 1.11 1563 and rear admiral 18.5 1564, was a Danish prisoner in 1564-1571, then court junker, in 1578 the princess Elisabeth's court master, bailiff at Borgholm 1579-1584 and at Kalmar 1587-1590 and prefect in Algutsrums and Fö
2 CONC rbo hd on Öland 1579-1583 and in Norra Möre 1589-1599 and previously married on 10.11.1577 at Uppsala castle to Gertrud Ulfsdotter ( Bååt ), who died 19.4 1588. His seat farm was 1573-1577 Boatorp in Moheda sn. Allbo hd but from 1
2 CONC 578 Stensnäs in Ryssby sn, Sunnerbo hd. Beheaded in Kalmar 16.5 1599.
2 CONT
2 CONT
