2 DATE 23 OCT 1648
2 PLAC Tumleberg
2 ADDR
3 CITY Essunga
3 STAE Skaraborgs län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 DEAT
2 DATE 14 FEB 1711
2 PLAC Häggatorp
2 ADDR
3 CITY Laske-Vedum
3 STAE Skaraborgs län
3 CTRY Sweden
1 BURI
2 DATE 5 MAR 1711
2 PLAC Hiertagraven i Vedums kyrka
