2 CONC rhaninge church Stockholms län, where his shield with the Ulf weapon and signature was set up. '''Married 1560-10-21 to his sister-in-law's sister Kerstin Marboin her 1st marriage (married 2nd 1575-06-12 at Hällerstad 9 to the pre
2 CONC fect Tyge Larsson, knighted Gyllencreutz , in his 1st marriage, died 1625), died 1603 8 , daughter of the castle law at Stegeborg, chamber councilor Truls Andersson Skrivare (Marbo) to Ravanäs, who in the coat of arms brought half
2 CONC  a lily and a star, and his 3rd wife Karin Eriksdotter Slätte (no. 97).'''
