2 CONT * Captain of the fleet in 1606. Admiral of the Kalmar fleet 1609-02-25. Staatholder at Kalmar castle 1611. Colonel of all Småland's cavalry and jacks 1612-01-04. Assistant judge in Svea Court of Appeal 16-02-1614. Vice president o
2 CONC f the Svea court of appeals in 1621. Died in 1627. His children adopted the name Bååt after the (war) weapon.	
