2 CONC n 1633-07-02 Karlstad (no. 32).  The Swedens Archives of Letter Collections and Correspondence shows that Elin Jakobsdotter Boat used her son-in Law, Carl Jönsson Pig Head Seal to exchange of goods with Carl Bonde on 02-07-1633. C
2 CONC arl Jönsson Pig Head was married to Elin Jakobsdotter Baat daughter Margareta Lennartsdotter Svenske.
2 CONT * [https://books.google.com/books?id=hY5AAAAAcAAJ&pg=PA368&lpg=PA368&dq=Lennart+Pedersson+Svenske&source=bl&ots=Gx5pQ14bfl&sig=ACfU3U1pMZhdaNNkxA6El6JKQrS2H2c5PA&hl=en&sa=X&ved=2ahUKEwjVg4_Mv9juAhWOtZ4KHdonD3o4FBDoATAGegQICRAB#v=o
