1 OCCU Riksdagsman, Häradshövding och häradsskrivare i Rånnum, Tunhems fs (Väne härad), domare, Adlig nr 258, Riksrådsdomare, häradshövding
1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Peder Bengtsson Svenske, til Rånnum=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Bengt Pedersson Svenske and Gyrith Torstensdotter (Forstena) 
2 CONT * Peder Svenske (No 258), dead 1616/1623. District Judge in Rånnum, Tunhems FS (Ha).
2 CONT * Lord of Rånnum. Attended the Riksdag in Stockholm 1582 and Ständermötet därstädes 1590. In the register of Swedish nobility 1586, when he writes to Rånnum. Was District Judge in Väne hundred after father 1588 and even 1600; Was 
2 CONC a judge of the Riksdag in Linköping 1600. lived 1616 in June, but was dead 1623.
2 CONT * [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svenske_nr_258 Peder Svenske (son of Bengt Svenske,( Tab. 3,) to Rånnum.] Shepherd chief in Väne after the father in 1588 and still 1600. Was dead in 1623. Married to Margareta Kagg, daughte
2 CONC r of the ruler Mattias Nilsson Kagg (no. 68) and his 2nd wife Elin Gustafsdotter (Forstenaätten) 
2 CONT * Peder (son of Bengt), two Rånnum. attended the parliament. In Stockholm 1582 and the Standing Meeting There. 1590. The Register of Sweden's nobility 1586, when he writes to Rånnum. Was District judge in Väne. The Father 1588 and
2 CONC  even 1600. was one of riksråds judges in Linköping 1600. Lived 1616-06-0016, but was dead 1623. Married to Margareta Kagg, daughter of Häradshövdingen Mattias Nilsson Kagg (No. 68) and his 2nd Wife Elin gustafs Daughter (Forstena
2 CONC ätt). Sources: EÄ VIII.
2 CONT
2 CONT =Married=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Married to [https://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Svenske_nr_258 '''Margareta Kagg (No 68)'''] daughter of Häradshövdingen Mattias Nilsson Kagg (No. 68) and his 2nd Wife Elin gustafs Daughter (Forstenaätt). Sources: EÄ VIII. Sour
2 CONC ces: EÄ VIII, Tab 
2 CONT
2 CONT =Children=
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Lennart. Rittmeister,''' (son of Peder Svenske, Swedish), to Säter in Eskilsäters parish. Ryttmästare. Was dead in 1626. Married to Elin Jakobsdotter, daughter of the unmarried rider Jacob Jonsson to Lång in Grums parish and H
2 CONC olmfrid Pedersdotter (Stårck) (Ramstad's genus)).
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Captain Johan Svenske,''' son of Peder Svenske Swedish) Married to Märta Thomson, daughter of Colonel Tomas Thomson, natural. Thomson no 299 and Catharina Mauritzdotter Murray.  Children: Hans Månsson Swedish. Born before 1634
2 CONC . Equestrian. Dead 1677
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Anna Svenskedotter,'''  lived 1640 on the pile in Väne hundred. married before 1618 with Lieutenant Colonel Jens Peders son (Dahlepil, No. 663).
2 CONT
2 CONT *'''Barbro Svenskedotter,''' Married before 1618 with the commanding man in cheeks and marks hundreds Bengt Arvidsson, Gentiles.
2 CONT
2 CONT
