2 CONT
2 CONT '''Dating; 1536 November 16'''
2 CONT '''Place of issue:  Maliala village in Janakkala''' 
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Peter Svenske, prefect of Hattula , confirms the purchase of part of Lanakoski kvarnfors in Janakkala.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Sources''' Medieval Transcripts:  Vid. 15380203, LUB (Dlga), Post-medieval copies:  Stafsundsark., Fersenska kontoret 266, pag. 1338-9, RA 0107.17, Printed, BFH III No. 85, Last Modified, 2015-06-05
