1 NAME Thomas Henriksson /Thomson/
2 GIVN Thomas Henriksson
2 _MARNM Thomson
1 SEX M
1 BIRT
2 ADDR
3 CTRY Scotland
1 DEAT
2 DATE 1643
2 ADDR
