1 NOTE {geni:about_me} =Staffan Bengtsson (Vinstorp)=
2 CONT
2 CONT * Son of Lord of Vinstorp manor Bengt Uddsson (Vinstorp) and Kristina Staffansdotter Ulv
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT
2 CONT http://www.adelsvapen.com/genealogi/Vinstorpa%C3%A4tten#TAB_3
2 CONT
2 CONT '''TABLE 3'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Staffan Bengtsson (son of Bengt Uddsson''', tab. 2). Mentioned in 1454. Was knighted on 19.1 1458 and was thus probably dubbed at Christian I's coronation. Was councilor in 1463. Fell on King Kristian's side in the battle of Br
2 CONC unkeberg 10.10 1471. Received the right to Ottenby in Ås sn in Gräsgårds hd on Öland 8.6 1458. Received Götala kungsgård in Skara landsförasmalling in Skånings hd in Västergötland as a grant from Archbishop Jöns Bengtsson ( Oxenst
2 CONC ierna ) 16.8 1466. Denied the seat of Vinstorp by Sten Sture in 1471. '''Married 16.1 1463 to Ingeborg Åkesdotter, who was the daughter of the knight and councilor Åke Jönsson ( Svarte Skåning ). Mrs. Ingeborg remarried before 2.2
2 CONC  1480 to Riksrader Erik Gustavsson ( Laurens Haraldsson's ätt ) and probably died before 7.5 1482.'''
2 CONT
2 CONT '''Daughter''':
2 CONT
2 CONT * '''Mekthild Staffansdotter.''' Still alive 23.4 1480 but was dead 7.5 1482. In 1472 regained the estates condemned by his father. Owned estates in Frökinds, Kinds, Kåkinds and Redvägs hd in Västergötland.
2 CONT
2 CONT
