2 CONT Armsman Sigge Larsson in Skofteby renews and confirms the exchange his father Lars Siggesson made with Bishop Hans in Skara, whereby the bishop received Ulläraff (now Ullered in Otterstads parish, Kålland district) for Kvättack (N
2 CONC äs parish in Vartofta district), because the deed of exchange which then was written according to Bishop Hans' message had burned up in a fire in Läckö, and promises that, in the event Ullered should go the bishop out of his hands
2 CONC , within 6 weeks make good to him therefore.
