2 CONC rreg (1941); STb 2, 4 (1931—44); Sthlms stads jordebok 1420—74 (1876), s 243, 320; A A v Stiernman, Swea o Götha Höfdinga-Minne, 2 (1835); CG Styffe, Skandinavien under unionstiden (3 uppl, 1911); Sveriges krig 1611—32, 2 (1936); 
