1 NOTE {geni:about_me} ♊ '''Brita Catharina Giös''' is [https://www.geni.com/path/Eric-af-Kumo+is+related+to+Brita-Catharina-Gi%C3%B6s?from=6000000019395507263&path_type=blood&to=6000000000106722062 '''Eric Larsson af Kumo's'''] 7th grea
